#
# TLS fingerprints whose connections are cut: XGS: Settings, "Cut connections by TLS fingerprint".
# Started every minute, the script reads the Intrusion Detection's log every two seconds for 58
# seconds, so a connection is cut within seconds of its first message; with no fingerprint listed it
# ends at once. A run still reading when the next starts keeps the lock, and the new one ends.
* * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/xgs/ja4_cut.py --for 58 > /dev/null 2>&1
